\n\nFive traits sit in the open. The sixth is a charm behind glass.\n\n$LOCKET is a token on Pons. Each piece carries five public traits and one sealed charm. The charm is encrypted in your own browser with AES-256-GCM before anything is sent, so the chain only ever holds ciphertext and a commitment. The key is wrapped for Lit Protocol V3, where an immutable Lit action asks the chain who owns the piece right now, over a pinned RPC, and hands the key back only to that wallet.\n\nSell the piece and the same locked charm moves with it. Nothing gets resealed, and the new holder opens it. A former holder may keep anything they already opened, because glass cannot unsee.\n\nBuilt with Lit Protocol. Until a real end-to-end test passes, buying, minting and Lit access stay closed, and every charm stays latched.\n\n⊡ latched · $LOCKET","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://www.locket.host/"},{"type":"twitter","url":"https://x.com/Locketensor"}],"cto":false},{"url":"https://dexscreener.com/robinhood/0xafe98625cc3c6691fc2c2fe19b852016c98c2ca7","chainId":"robinhood","tokenAddress":"0xAFe98625cc3C6691FC2c2FE19b852016C98C2Ca7","icon":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/P5hgI8A0-rUQg-PF?width=64&height=64&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","header":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/cms/images/lvgpsYoUbEzbpTyY?width=600&height=200&fit=crop&quality=95&format=auto","openGraph":"https://cdn.dexscreener.com/token-images/og/robinhood/0xafe98625cc3c6691fc2c2fe19b852016c98c2ca7?timestamp=1790612700000","description":"Repoken turns any GitHub repo into a token on-chain. Sign in with GitHub, pick a repo, and launch in one signature via PONS on Robinhood Chain (Uniswap V3, fixed 1B supply).\n\nEvery community launch carries a 2% tax: 1% buys back & burns $REPOKEN, 1% goes to the creator. $REPOKEN's own 2% tax goes to the dev wallet. All on-chain, all verifiable.","links":[{"label":"Website","url":"https://repoken.fun/"},{"label":"Docs","url":"https://github.com/repoken/repoken"},{"type":"tw